        "content": "### Token Usage\n\nCopilot token usage is present in Jaeger traces in this stack, but it is not exported to Prometheus, so there is no live token chart to render here yet.\n\nVerified live trace fields\n- `gen_ai.usage.input_tokens`\n- `gen_ai.usage.cache_read.input_tokens`\n- `gen_ai.usage.output_tokens`\n- `gen_ai.usage.reasoning.output_tokens`\n- `github.copilot.turn_count`\n- `github.copilot.session.usage_info` log fields such as `github.copilot.current_tokens`\n\nUse Jaeger with service `github-copilot` to inspect per-trace token usage. To graph tokens here, the collector would need to export those values as metrics or logs.",
