      "options": {
        "content": "### Useful Explore queries\n\nPrometheus\n- `sum by (span_name) (max_over_time(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}[$__range]))`\n- `sum by (model) (label_replace(max_over_time(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\",span_name=~\"chat .+\"}[$__range]), \"model\", \"$1\", \"span_name\", \"chat (.+)\"))`\n- `sum by (tool) (label_replace(max_over_time(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\",span_name=~\"execute_tool .+\"}[$__range]), \"tool\", \"$1\", \"span_name\", \"execute_tool (.+)\"))`\n- `sum by (mcp_tool) (label_replace(max_over_time(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\",span_name=~\"execute_tool github-mcp-server-.+\"}[$__range]), \"mcp_tool\", \"$1\", \"span_name\", \"execute_tool (github-mcp-server-.+)\"))`\n- `histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, tool) (label_replace(max_over_time(traces_span_metrics_duration_milliseconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service_name\",span_name=~\"execute_tool .+\"}[$__range]), \"tool\", \"$1\", \"span_name\", \"execute_tool (.+)\")))`\n\nJaeger\n- Search service `github-copilot` to inspect per-trace token and turn metadata.\n\nNotes\n- This dashboard mirrors the Codex layout where the underlying Copilot telemetry makes that possible: overview stats, operation totals, model, tool, and MCP breakdowns, distributions, and latency.\n- The old Copilot dashboard used obsolete metric names. The collector currently exports `traces_span_metrics_*`, not `traces_spanmetrics_*`.\n- Copilot token usage and turn details are present in Jaeger trace tags and logs, but they are not exported as Prometheus metrics by this stack.\n- This stack does not ship Copilot logs to Loki, so there are no Copilot log panels here.\n- The default service name in the current local dataset is `github-copilot`.",
